(a) PART 1 BASIS: ml.recipes / ml-for-science-reproducibility-tutorial
------------------------------------------------------------------------

01_classic_xai.ipynb and solutions/01_classic_xai_solutions.ipynb are a
rebuild, extension, and correction of teaching material originally developed
for the "ml.recipes" / ml-for-science-reproducibility-tutorial project.
Notable changes made in this rebuild include: fixing a hardcoded
label-ordering bug in the historical Sex -> Female/Male one-hot tree
importance example (now using get_feature_names_out()), adding real
individual conditional expectation (ICE) curves alongside the historical
partial dependence averages, and replacing the deprecated JS-based
shap.initjs()/force_plot API with the modern matplotlib-native SHAP API
(shap.plots.waterfall, shap.plots.beeswarm).

